      "type": "single_choice",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "e^x 在 x = 0 处展开到二次项是：",
      "options": {
        "A": "1 + x + x^2/2 + o(x^2)",
        "B": "1 + x + x^2 + o(x^2)",
        "C": "1 - x + x^2/2 + o(x^2)",
        "D": "x + x^2/2 + o(x^2)"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "e^x = Σ x^n/n!，二次截断即 1 + x + x^2/2，余项为 o(x^2)。"
